            <title>1.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:15:41 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>What's new in Tuck 1.1.0</h3><ul>
<li>Saved collections: press ⌘S on a clip to keep it forever in a named collection, like your addresses. Saved clips survive Clear History.</li>
<li>Filters: show only pinned clips, text, links, images, files or one of your collections. Press Tab to switch.</li>
<li>Select several clips with ⇧↑↓ or ⌘-click to pin, hide, save or delete them together.</li>
<li>Paste Stack: select several clips and press ↩, and each ⌘V pastes the next one. Press ⌥↩ to paste them all at once.</li>
<li>Clear Recent in the menu bar deletes what you copied in the last few minutes, and clears the clipboard if it still holds it.</li>
<li>Redesigned Settings with a sidebar, plain explanations for every option, and an Auto-Paste on/off switch.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
